{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 222 AD, Liu Bei launched a campaign against Wu. Overnight, hundreds of thousands of his soldiers mysteriously vanished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you wake from unconsciousness, you find yourself trapped inside an eerie tower that has risen from the ground. Surrounded by unfamiliar stone walls, the air thick with the stench of decay, the entire army has been swallowed by this colossal tower\u2014only a handful of survivors remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon in hand, you grope your way through layers of unfamiliar structures. Enemies may lurk in every shadow. There is no turning back in this tower\u2014only forward, step by step, as you uncover the truth behind the army's disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alive, find the exit, or\u2014become part of the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the familiar expedition of Shu Han plunges into an eerie abyss, you will experience a wild legend never recorded in history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b8 Top-Down Hardcore Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face powerful enemies, execute precise dodges, and master the Souls-like combat rhythm of seizing every attack opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697230/extras/a5c3f2eaf8c23699d2805932e7d04dad.poster.avif?t=1773899485\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697230/extras/a5c3f2eaf8c23699d2805932e7d04dad.webm?t=1773899485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697230/extras/a5c3f2eaf8c23699d2805932e7d04dad.mp4?t=1773899485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_im